      "writtenOn": "2024-04-19T23:01:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removed posix. FYI:\n\nWith Posix:\n```\n    Memory region         Used Size  Region Size  %age Used\n                 ROM:      268516 B         1 MB     25.61%\n                 RAM:       59904 B       256 KB     22.85%\n            IDT_LIST:          0 GB         2 KB      0.00%\n```\nWithout Posix:\n```\n   Memory region         Used Size  Region Size  %age Used\n                 ROM:      264216 B         1 MB     25.20%\n                 RAM:       59904 B       256 KB     22.85%\n            IDT_LIST:          0 GB         2 KB      0.00%\n```",
      "parentUuid": "7b7d7ba5_79c6ad5a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 8,
        "endChar": 19
